    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "This is precisely what _I didn't want_ to do in this proposal – I tried another approach (see https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4128#issuecomment-533633177). Not saying that one is better than another, just wanted to try something new and trigger discussion.\r\n\r\nHere I wanted the connector to still be in control of everything with the given information (e.g. \"is it showing more right now?\"). I tried to avoid the black box architecture that React InstantSearch creates.",
